From b5e68205f1b357e2eafb6e1a9f965148089e80cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <claude@local>
Date: Mon, 18 May 2026 14:11:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add design-skill (visual language) selector to wizard Step 7

Step7Data gains designSkill (11 variants: 4 original + 7 frontend-design
menu). New selector in Step7Aesthetic (first/highest-level choice),
required to proceed; surfaced in Step11Review. Brief is JSON.stringify
so it flows into briefJson automatically. Picking per-site is a primary
anti-footprint lever.

TODO (out of this repo): elite-pipeline-workflow Stage 5 renderSiteConfig
must read brief.step7.designSkill -> site.config.design.skill ->
data-skill; add 7 new skills.css blocks + restaurant-templates presets.
